---
id: thm-composition-of-function-limits
kind: theorem
title: "Composition of limits holds under either hypothesis: $f$ is defined at $L$ with value $M$, or $g$ avoids $L$ on a punctured neighbourhood of $c$"
status: published
origin: session
provenance:
