research/audit/wave7-certifier-tasks/cex-composition-of-limits-fails.md-191-
research/audit/wave7-certifier-tasks/cex-composition-of-limits-fails.md-192-**Given:** The function $f : \mathbb{R} \to \mathbb{R}$ of [[cex-limit-differs-from-the-value]], with $f(y) = 0$ for $y \ne 0$ and $f(0) = 1$; the constant function $g : \mathbb{R} \to \mathbb{R}$, $g(x) = 0$; the identity function $\iota : \mathbb{R} \to \mathbb{R}$, $\iota(x) = x$; and the point $c := 0$.
