research/audit/wave7-real-analysis-completeness-limits.proof-contracts.json:11025:          "claim": "Both extra hypotheses of [[thm-composition-of-function-limits]] fail for this pair: hypothesis (i) fails because $L = 0$ lies in $B = \\mathbb{R}$ while $f(L) = f(0) = 1 \\ne 0 = M$; and hypothesis (ii) fails because $g(x) = 0 = L$ for every $x$, so no punctured neighbourhood of $0$ avoids the value $L$.",
