--
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/certifier-cex-composition-of-limits-fails.prompt.md-247-[L2] Every real is a limit point of $\mathbb{R}$, punctured neighbourhoods being never empty ([[def-limit-point-r]], [[def-neighbourhood-r]]).
